msgid "The add-on could not be installed or updated. Try again from the Plugins screen."
msgstr "Tillegget kunne ikke installeres eller oppdateres. Prøv igjen fra Utvidelser-siden."

#: includes/Plugin.php:37
msgid "Loupe Search Add-ons lives in Settings → Loupe Search. Activate Loupe Search to manage its add-ons."
msgstr "Loupe Search-tillegg finner du under Innstillinger → Loupe Search. Aktiver Loupe Search for å behandle tilleggene."

